Package: mudataR
Title: Native MuData for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Maximilian", "Nuber", , "maximilian.d.nuber@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read, write and manipulate MuData multimodal containers (H5MU
    files and MuData Zarr stores) natively in R, without Python. Modalities
    are genuine 'anndataR' AnnData objects backed by the matching store, and
    ragged Awkward Array data such as 'scirpy' immune receptor repertoires
    are available as nested Arrow data. Works with released 'anndataR'
    through its public API only.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MaximilianNuber/mudataR
